WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:07.850
We have a really serious situation of authoritarianism
that ties into suppression of speech, actual

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.669
suppression of speech.

00:00:09.669 --> 00:00:14.369
It possibly ties into the plan to steal this
election in November by Donald Trump.

00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:19.250
And what's happening is that paramilitary
federal law enforcement officers have been

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.040
dispatched to Portland, Oregon.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.380
They're grabbing people, including protesters,
not just looters.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.320
They're taking them away in unmarked vehicles.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.920
They don't have badges.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.730
And this has been confirmed by the Department
of Homeland Security.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.230
This is really actually serious.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:38.839
These paramilitaries are driving around in
unmarked cars wearing camouflage, really more

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:43.129
appropriate for the desert than downtown Portland,
Oregon.

00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:47.770
Protesters are being detained even in the
absence of evidence that any crime was committed.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:52.010
And this is an authoritarian type show of
force.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.829
The claim from Department of Homeland Security
is that these troops, which really is what

00:00:55.829 --> 00:01:01.140
they are, are being sent to Portland to keep
the peace and to protect federal property.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:06.880
The stories we're hearing are that people
are being grabbed, thrown in unmarked vans,

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:10.340
taken to undisclosed locations, not being
accused of any crime.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.210
In many cases, some are.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.800
And in most cases they are being released.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.300
Some are charged with crimes.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:22.330
Some of the people being detained are not
even near federal property, which is supposedly

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.880
the reason these federal troops are there
in the first place.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.640
And many aren't being told why they are being
detained.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:32.500
They are just protesters protected by the
First Amendment.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.600
The mayor of Portland, Ted Wheeler, says he
didn't ask for help.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.420
He has asked the federal troops to leave,
and yet there they are.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.270
So that's story number one.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.150
What is actually happening on the ground?

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:47.690
And we're still getting more information about
what's happening there.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:54.240
The second story is that this is potentially
a test of what may happen in many cities starting

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.010
as soon as this week to repress protests.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:01.370
Charlie Pierce has a good piece about this
in Esquire, where he points out when Trump

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.630
tries something and gets away with it, he
does more of it.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:08.910
And Pierce is suggesting maybe this is a dry
run for what Trump was threatening at the

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.340
start of the George Floyd protests a couple
of months ago.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:18.690
Major deployments of militarized law enforcement
or even straight up military to urban areas.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.340
So there's two substories to that second story.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:27.770
Number one is the authoritarianism spreading
to repress protests.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:32.170
The second part is actually trying to cause
confrontations.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:38.640
The troops, that is in order to benefit Trump
politically by pointing to violent protesters,

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.350
which they will induce to violence.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:47.180
We've already seen reports that the protests,
the protests themselves are seeing more unrest

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.520
in Portland since the deployment of the troops.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.710
So there's the authoritarianism.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:57.630
But there's also the deployment of troops
to create unrest, to then point to look at

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.430
all these violent people.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:06.160
We need a bigger show of force, which gets
us to the third piece of this, which is these

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:13.890
authoritarian forces being sent into cities
now could be a trial balloon for sending or

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:20.380
keeping them in cities in November for the
purpose of intimidating around the election.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.930
And that would be like the closure of the
loop in terms of what's going on.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:29.800
That strategy requires some foresight, which
Trump does not seem able to do.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:32.080
But William Barr certainly would be capable
of that.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.310
And some of the others involved may well be.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:39.950
Now, in terms of legality, of course, Trump's
Justice Department and DHS say this is legal.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:44.020
The ACLU and other lawyers have said, you
know this.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.130
This could arguably be kidnaping and abduction.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.130
Right.

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:51.500
I mean, you've got paramilitaries without
badges and cammo in unmarked cars, grabbing

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:56.010
people, taking them away, often not telling
them what crime they're suspected of committing

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:59.760
and eventually releasing them without having
charged them of any crime.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.090
It is going in the direction of a secret police
sort of thing.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.360
Now to take a brief detour.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:10.260
This is important as an opportunity to prepare
you for some bad arguments from the right

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:15.270
about this right wing darling Ben Shapiro
tweeted in response to some of what we're

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:20.109
seeing in Portland, quote, Fascism is not
federal law enforcement enforcing the law

00:04:20.109 --> 00:04:25.460
against rioters and looters and they are arresting
rioters and looters in Portland.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.900
Not mere protesters.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:32.060
Fascism is the Chinese government shuttling
wiggers by train to concentration camps?

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:35.419
Well, he's right that that certainly is fascistic.

00:04:35.419 --> 00:04:36.419
What's.

00:04:36.419 --> 00:04:42.081
Going on in China and everybody should be
calling it out and and most people are, but

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.540
there is a petri dish of nonsense here.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:49.050
It's almost like a one sentence Gish Gallop,
because a lot of stuff is being mixed up.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:54.240
It is true that law enforcement arresting
criminals is not fascism.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.590
That that that's completely true.

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.560
That's not actually what's at issue here.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:04.680
What we have here are countless videos of
mere protesters being brutally repressed,

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:07.590
who have not looted, who have not rioted.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:13.830
We have law enforcement in unmarked cars popping
out in a city in cammo.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:18.340
That does not match the urban setting in which
they're operating, wearing desert cammo without

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.540
badges.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.960
That is deliberate intimidation that's starting
to border on some of the stuff you see in

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.000
authoritarian and totalitarian states.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.600
And to top it off, there are reports coming
in of people being taken off to undisclosed

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:35.490
locations, not being given due process, just
being held and ultimately released.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:40.419
So don't fall for law enforcement doing law
enforcement work.

00:05:40.419 --> 00:05:41.419
Isn't fascism.

00:05:41.419 --> 00:05:42.460
No, it's not.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.460
That's not what this is about.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:51.030
This is about camouflaged military in unmarked
vehicles sent in to repress protests, possibly

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:56.570
as a trial balloon for intimidation to happen
nationally as we approach Election Day.

00:05:56.570 --> 00:06:02.640
We almost have a situation where Portland,
Portland police officers should be protecting

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:07.270
protesters from the guys with no badges in
the unmarked vans.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.440
That's how crazy it is.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.889
Don't we have a right to know who is policing
us?

00:06:10.889 --> 00:06:16.360
Aren't combattants as insane as that word
is required to indicate who they are and who

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.380
they work for?

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:22.820
Anonymous police and cammo with no badges
is what's going on right now.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.810
This could just as easily be some right wing
militia as it could be a prison riot squad

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:27.810
being repurposed.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:32.480
And in fact, how long will it be until some
right wing militia that looks just like these

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:37.520
guys kidnaps and kills someone and it gets
swept under the rug?

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:41.680
This city should file a lawsuit and put it
in the hands of the courts.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:46.509
I'd be lying if I said I knew how the courts
would rule on what's going on.

00:06:46.509 --> 00:06:48.070
This is still developing.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:08:35.120
We will have more upcoming.

